# Product Profile example (DG-2.2)

Worked example for **Path B / product #2 at rung G1** (guest-viable stub). Shows what belongs in **C** (manifest) vs **thin W** vs **forbidden clone**. Not a live `pluginId` — a template for DG-4.

## Scenario

| Role | Example | Maturity |
| ---- | ------- | -------- |
| Reference G3 | `denali` (mountain / adventure) | certified |
| Proof stub | `urban` (city) | Phase 7 proof — not the default DG-4 vehicle |
| Scaffold | `starter` | G0 — owns `basics.*` paths (DG-2.1: no Denali catalog alias) |
| **Product #2 (target)** | new `pluginId` e.g. `harbor` (waterfront city club) | **G1 stub** — scaffolded in **DG-4.0** (`packages/workspaces/harbor`) |

Business intent stays **OD-1 = 1b** (new pluginId). Do not re-charter Urban as the second certified family unless Architect flips OD-1.

## C — manifest deltas only (city/harbor vs mountain)

Express G1 differences in `workspace.manifest.json` (+ theme CSS), **not** by forking Denali HTTP forests.

| Concern | Mountain (`denali`) pattern | Harbor G1 profile (C) | Notes |
| ------- | --------------------------- | --------------------- | ----- |
| HTTP prefix | `/denali` | `/harbor` | `http.prefix` + route manifest paths |
| Production tier | `certified` | `stub` | Fail-closed for prod provision |
| Catalog list filters | server filters: `q`, difficulty, fitness, … | `cityFilter: true` **or** minimal filters | `catalogPresentation.listFeatures` |
| Catalog detail | itinerary / difficulty / fitness on | city venue / policies off until G2 | `catalogPresentation.detailSections` |
| Registration flow | Denali transport + profile fields | compose shared auth steps + thin intake/done | `catalogRegistrationFlow.steps.mode: compose` (see guest-club) |
| Member profile | nationalId, fatherName, birthDate, … | `displayName` (+ email read-only) | `memberProfile.editableFields` |
| Guest landing | rich Denali sections | `variant: minimal`, sections mostly false | `guestLanding` |
| SEO | Denali marketing keys | harbor i18n keys only | `guestSeo` + message namespace |
| Theme | Denali tokens | harbor `theme/tokens.css` + guest stylesheets | `themeStylesheets` / `guestThemeStylesheets` |
| Wizard field paths | Denali `title`, frozen paths | **Own** registry paths (`basics.title` style) | **Never** `aliasCatalogWorkspaceType: "denali"` |
| Wizard template alias | — | omit `wizardTemplate` alias block | DG-2.1 |

### Illustrative C snippet (not checked in as a package)

```json
{
  "id": "harbor",
  "guestConformance": { "productionTier": "stub" },
  "http": { "prefix": "/harbor", "module": "./http/routes" },
  "catalogPresentation": {
    "listFeatures": { "cityFilter": true },
    "detailSections": {
      "difficulty": false,
      "fitness": false,
      "itinerary": false,
      "policies": true
    }
  },
  "catalogRegistrationFlow": {
    "surfaceExport": "harborCatalogRegistrationFlowSurface",
    "steps": {
      "mode": "compose",
      "reuseAuthStepsFrom": "shared",
      "components": { "intake": "HarborIntakeStep", "done": "HarborDoneStep" }
    }
  },
  "memberProfile": {
    "editableFields": ["displayName"],
    "readOnlyFields": ["email"]
  },
  "guestLanding": { "variant": "minimal", "i18nProfile": "minimal" }
}
```

## Thin W — required adapters (budget)

Target **≤ 15** new modules for G1 (TEMP DG-4 metric). Prefer P-lib calls; keep product literals in W.

**Count rule (DG-6.5):** count TypeScript source files under `src/`, excluding
neutral barrel/loader basenames `index.ts`, `react.ts`, and `routes.ts`. Keep
`routes-manifest.ts` in the count because it is workspace configuration. Harbor
currently measures **10 / 15** by this reproducible rule.

| # | Adapter (W) | Calls | Must not contain |
| - | ----------- | ----- | ---------------- |
| 1 | `workspace.manifest.json` + messages | codegen | — |
| 2 | `*.plugin.ts` + field registry | SDK plugin contract | Denali field ids |
| 3 | `http/routes-manifest.ts` | `WorkspaceHttpMethod` | hand-rolled method unions |
| 4 | `http/routes.ts` + `product.routes.ts` | P-lib envelopes / public-auth / catalog list helpers | copy of Denali dashboard/reminder/finance |
| 5 | `http/catalog.service.ts` | clamp/cursor/exposure P-lib | Denali filter/photo/spots pipeline |
| 6 | `http/registration.service.ts` | type-gate / capacity / not-published P-lib | Denali booking-port orchestration |
| 7 | `http/host-ports.ts` + `host-runtime.ts` | `createWorkspaceHttpHostSlot` | second hand-rolled slot |
| 8 | `resolve-*-public-auth.ts` | `resolveWorkspacePublicAuthFromRequest` | local header parsers |
| 9 | coded errors | `defineWorkspaceCodedError` | ad-hoc Error subclasses without code |
| 10 | publish transition + field-gate | DG-1.4 P-lib | duplicate boolean matrices |
| 11 | intake/done UI steps | compose registration flow | Denali profile form clones |
| 12 | theme CSS | tokens only | Denali marketing section CSS dumps |
| 13 | exposure surfaces (minimal) | SDK exposure types | Denali reminder/offset matrix |
| 14–15 | tests + smoke fixtures | package specs | apps/api product branches |

**P-lib already available (DG-1):** public auth, catalog list/page/envelope, owner mutation, publish transition/field-gate, host slot, coded errors, registration guards, success/404 envelopes.

## Explicit non-goals for this profile

| Do not | Why |
| ------ | --- |
| Copy `packages/workspaces/denali/src/http/**` forest | Clone detector FAIL |
| `aliasCatalogWorkspaceType: "denali"` | Reopens gravity (fixed in DG-2.1 for starter) |
| Certify at G3 parity | OD-5 = G1 or G2 |
| Move handlers into `apps/api` | Host stays loader/codegen-only |
| Finance / ledger / equipment in G1 | DG-F / G2+ |

## Verification checklist (when DG-4 implements harbor)

```text
pnpm run generate:workspace-registry --check
pnpm --filter @app-tour/workspace-sdk test   # product-neutral
# G1 smoke: marketing catalog → portal register (env-dependent)
# Clone detector: no large rename-parallel stem set vs denali/urban
```

## Relation to live workspaces

| Workspace | Role in this example |
| --------- | -------------------- |
| `denali` | G3 reference — peel later (DG-3), do not clone |
| `urban` | City-shaped **proof**, not OD-1 default product #2 |
| `guest-club` | Compose registration + minimal presentation pattern to copy |
| `starter` | Scaffold field paths + theme; **no** Denali wizard catalog alias |
